# Graphify and codegraph

graphify-out is a macro map. Do not treat its node counts as the current architecture until a source fingerprint says the graph matches the tree you are reading. Inferred edges stay inferred.

scripts/codegraph.mjs reads apps/web imports only. It skips tests and it is not a whole-repo call graph. Its output under .ai-context/codegraph is gitignored.

Cursor starts Graphify from .cursor/mcp.json through scripts/graphify-mcp-launcher.mjs and the pins in scripts/graphify-pins.mjs. Do not point that server at an unpinned installer or at a hosted Graphify endpoint.
